+Pair the two computers in KDE Connect, then press Catch to make the receiver discoverable.
+Catch uses the handset identity from the same KDE Connect session.
+The control connection requires both peers' current pairing certificates.
+Removing the pairing closes the control connection and releases its desktop lease.
